msgid "Getting started with SmallRye Stork"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The essence of distributed systems resides in the interaction between "
"services.\n"
"In modern architecture, you often have multiple instances of your service to "
"share the load or improve the resilience by redundancy.\n"
"But how do you select the best instance of your service?\n"
"That's where https://smallrye.io/smallrye-stork[SmallRye Stork] helps.\n"
"Stork is going to choose the most appropriate instance.\n"
"It offers:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Extensible service discovery mechanisms"
msgstr ""

msgid "Built-in support for Consul and Kubernetes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Customizable client load-balancing strategies"
msgstr ""

msgid "This technology is considered {extension-status}."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In _preview_, backward compatibility and presence in the ecosystem is not "
"guaranteed.\n"
"Specific improvements might require changing configuration or APIs, and "
"plans to become _stable_ are under way.\n"
"Feedback is welcome on our https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-"
"dev[mailing list] or as issues in our https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/"
"issues[GitHub issue tracker]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a full list of possible statuses, check our https://quarkus.io/faq/#what-"
"are-the-extension-statuses[FAQ entry]."
msgstr ""

